  "reading_this": [
    "units_per_sec is the comparable quantity across hardware classes: it is computed from wall clock over the whole level, so overlapped requests are not double-counted.",
    "request_latency_ms at concurrency > 1 includes queueing AND the network round trip. It is not engine latency and must not be quoted as one.",
    "candle is the outcome reference, not an arm: it is in-process and has no socket, so putting it on this axis would compare a function call to a web request."
  ],
